#This is a sample file distributed with Galaxy that enables tools
#to use a motus DB folder. The motus_db_versioned.loc
#file needs this format (longer white space is the TAB character):

#<value>	<version>	<name>	<path>

# for example:

# motus41	mOTUs 4.1 database	v4.1	/data/motus/db_mOTU_parent

# IMPORTANT (mOTUs v4): the path must point to the directory that CONTAINS
# the "db_mOTU" folder, and the "db_mOTU.downloaded" marker file must exist
# inside "db_mOTU" (e.g. after running "motus downloadMGDB").
